      if(id==='critiquedaemon')return `<div class="aura-app-intro"><small>PERMANENT REVIEW SERVICE / CRITIQUE DAEMON</small><h4>Continuous restraint assessment</h4><p>The reviewer cannot be dismissed. It has been determined that dismissal would introduce unnecessary expressive risk.</p></div><div class="aura-critique-report"><div class="aura-daemon-eye large"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 5 95 31v38L50 95 5 69V31Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M15 50Q50 15 85 50 50 85 15 50Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="12" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><b>“The blank canvas is your most daring work to date.”</b><p>Review interval: 45 seconds. Findings are generated locally from the absence of new deliverables.</p><small>REVIEW STATUS: CONTINUOUS · DISMISSAL: NOT AUTHORIZED</small></div>`;
